# Build context for the single-origin image.
#
# The image builds the SPA and the API from source, so compiled output and
# dependency trees must never enter the context: a local node_modules is
# hundreds of megabytes, is platform-specific, and would shadow the clean
# `npm ci` inside the image. CI masks all of this because a fresh clone has
# neither — which is exactly why this file exists.

# Version control and local config
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*

# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
backend/bin

# Local/editor noise
**/*.log
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
